# Linux line endings in every checkout, Windows too. Git on Windows turns
# LF into CRLF by default, and the checks read source files and match
# across line breaks - "1 cloud checks FAILED" on GitHub's Windows machine
# was `\n` meeting `\r\n`, not anything wrong with the app. PowerShell,
# Node and every editor here read LF fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# cmd.exe is the one reader that wants CRLF.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
